<DocsLayout title="Dasher Manual - Dasher">
  <h1>Dasher Manual</h1>

  <p class="author">By David J.C. MacKay</p>
  <p class="date">January 25, 2006 — Draft 1</p>

  <p class="note">The first part of this manual assumes you are steering Dasher with a mouse, in order to write in English. Dasher also works in over a hundred other languages. Please see the Dasher Special Needs Guide for information about alternatives to mouse-steering.</p>

  <nav class="manual-toc">
